r future in ways you can't imagine. Every choice counts and will affect the story as you progress through the various plots. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration Mode</strong>: You will be able to inspect the scenarios and take a closer look at elements that will reveal clues that can unlock new options during the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960950/extras/9897bf84378f54de5c8ed5538d341241.poster.avif?t=1761302926\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960950/extras/9897bf84378f54de5c8ed5538d341241.webm?t=1761302926\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960950/extras/9897bf84378f54de5c8ed5538d341241.mp4?t=1761302926\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Madness</strong>: The perception of the environment changes when the player starts to lose sanity. Maybe what you see is not what is really there!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replayability</strong>: There are multiple branches of the story you can play and multiple endings. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cthulhu Mythos references</strong>: You will find multiple references to the Cthulhu mythos hidden in the scenes of the game that you can discover and complete collections that will unlock more content. </p></li></ul>","developers":["Wildspell Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960950/83ff4cef5c6af1804c2f798cde589ef9cbac129d/header.jpg?t=1761302926","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 